            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Abatambyi b'abalewi bene Sadoki bajyaga bakora umurimo wo mu buturo bwanjye bwera igihe Abisirayeli bayobye bakanyimūra, ni bo bazanyegera kugira ngo bankorere. Bazajya bampagarara imbere banture ibinure n'amaraso. Ni ko Umwami Uwiteka avuga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi bazajye binjira mu buturo bwanjye bwera begere ameza yanjye kugira ngo bankorere, bakurikize amategeko yanjye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.28.39+EXO.28.40+EXO.28.41+EXO.28.42+EXO.28.43"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuva 28.39-43",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.16.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lewi 16.4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nibinjira mu marembo y'urugo rw'imbere bazajya baza bambaye imyambaro y'ibitare. Ntibakagire icyo bambara kirimo ubwoya igihe bakorera ku marembo y'urugo rw'imbere no mu rusengero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bajye bambara ibitambaro by'ibitare ku mutwe, bambare n'amakabutura y'ibitare, ntibakagire icyo bambara cyabatera gututubikana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.16.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lewi 16.23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi nibasohoka bagiye mu rugo rw'inyuma ari rwo rwa rubanda, bajye biyambura imyambaro yabo, iyo bambara bakorera Imana, bayibike mu byumba byera maze bambare indi myambaro kugira ngo bateza rubanda bambaye iyo myambaro yabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
